{"ID":"20240314092126-c9d7yrc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092126-c9d7yrc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092126-c9d7yrc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161859-2c4mt9n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161859-yu5l6z0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:367,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161859-yu5l6z0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:100\u0026#125;","title":"【附子粳米汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422161859-2c4mt9n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-2c4mt9n","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹中寒气，雷鸣切痛，胸胁逆满，呕吐，附子粳米汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-hvm8edz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-hvm8edz","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"附子粳米汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-m3kbk8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-m3kbk8q","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"附子一枚炮，半夏、粳米各半升，甘草一两，大枣十枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-nzqq19x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-nzqq19x","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，以水八升，煮米熟，汤成去滓，温服一升，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-g0n97zd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-g0n97zd","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方呢，诸位一定要学会。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-kt75vv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-kt75vv7","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么简单的处方，在我们佛罗里达，有个很有名的人，两年前死掉了。那个......三个兄弟啊唱歌的，他的二个弟弟，一个大哥带两个弟弟，弟弟呢，就是弹电子琴的那个，两年前，54 岁，死在迈阿密。为什么死在迈阿密，半夜突然起来肚子痛得要死，非常的强痛，就在迈阿密医院去看，小肠套叠嘛，套叠在一起嘛，开刀就好了。他家里有钱啊，又付得起啊，就肚子打开来，开了小肠......小肠跟心是表里的，本身不受病，开完就死在手术台上。他直接进去就把肠拉开来，他们在电视上发表一个言论，要花上亿的美金，我一定要知道我弟弟是怎么死的，开始打官司。所以呢，当然这个事件呢，不是说有没钱的问题，而是你可以不用死啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-wjdz27n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-wjdz27n","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个肚子痛算什么？这是腹的寒痛，我们肚子痛有两种，一种是热，寒热，还有虚实，你虚痛的话，按它只是满不会痛哦，实症的话我们把里边的大便清出来就好了。那如果遇到寒气的时候，寒则什么？寒则收！"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-okt99tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-okt99tw","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240325171303-8ongrvz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-sjjuu34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-sjjuu34","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本来小肠是这样子的，一寒的时候就套进去了，结果呢，这个小肠缩回去了（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"变短"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），就这样，套在里面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"套叠在一起的时候，拉锯的很痛，剧痛，雷鸣切痛，切痛就是很强烈的痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。肠子呢，不但鸣叫，咕噜咕噜叫哦。这种现象呢，它并不是说你有肿瘤有癌症，而只是突然发了一个寒症的痛。当然，当你肠子一堵到的时候，这个气当你呼吸的时候，吸气到中焦下不去啦，下面腹部太冷了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"气会回逆，就会有胸胁逆满的现象，病人呕吐，呕吐时因为肠子堵在一起了，套叠在一起，就是你东西吃下去吐掉，东西吃下去吐掉，当然不能吃啦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-m49m1fo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-m49m1fo","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"附子粳米汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你看这个处方设计的好不好。这就是经方，诸位，这经方呢，在治疗这种胸腹之间的寒痛哦，肠子套叠在一起的时候，第一副药的第一碗它就好了，第二碗还没吃哦，你还端在那边，他就好了，病人就好了，可以出院了，速度就哪么快。所以说，不是说你有没有钱要到医院去，这个如果说，我常跟我的病人讲，如果......是这个弟弟，他没保险，也没有钱的话，到医院去，医院丢在一边，你又不是癌症，就躺在一边，你又不会死，就肠子套叠在一起，反而没事。他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"死在有钱上面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你知道吗？反正刀开下去，他有钱不用担心他不付钱嘛。小肠怎么可以开刀呢？好，小肠不能动的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-t1hkwa7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-t1hkwa7","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看到附子粳米汤，炮附子，半夏。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏是止呕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子去里面的寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肚子的寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-2lnd8gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-2lnd8gq","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么要粳米呢？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际上我们真正去研究粳米是什么东西哦。我们现代的白米是不是一种糙米？白米的前身是糙米嘛对不对，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真正我们找粳米的时候，是糯米里边的糙米"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。就是以前的糯米。那糯米改良之后，你现在吃的糯米是白的。那这个之前糯米的糙米就是粳米。那是最好消化的甜米。那因为这个肠子梗到了，我们把寒去掉了，同时呢，把这个粳米放点下去，让肠子好消化，最好消化。所以呢，我们同时把寒去掉了，同时把恶心去掉，同时把小肠的津液再补回来。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-nfwcnvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-nfwcnvr","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这五味药以水 8 升来煮米熟，你看，汤成去渣，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"煮完米之后还有很多汤，所以你不能米放太多"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，米放太多就变成干饭了。老师，你说煮成干饭你吃，就不是附子粳米汤。那附子呢，平常我们开是 3 钱，我们加粳米的时候，汤匙，平匙两匙，半夏呢，跟粳米差不多，平哦。半夏也是 3 钱，等量。甘草一钱啊。那煮的时候，三碗水煮成一碗，或者是加重点，六碗水煮成三碗，看你的方便。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-fq112cl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-fq112cl","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际上这个处方呢，一剂就好了。那为什么它说煮成......我常常写的是九碗煮三碗，一天吃三次，哦，那我们早晚的时候吃一次，严重的时候，一天吃三次都没有关系。这个处方非常好用。我用过非常多。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人腹部寒痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的时候，你一看就知道。病人那舌头伸出来给我看看，一看，白色的，舌头是白色的，肚子叫的很厉害，也不是说里边堵在实症啊，你摸摸肚子，压下去很舒服，也没有大便堵道，小便淡白、清白色的。这是附子粳米汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-32dq2tu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-32dq2tu","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像临床上我们看的时候，过去我们要用到哪些地方呢？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胆结石引起的痛，临床上我用过子宫癌，肚子的寒气，寒痛，那这个药下去，痛就去掉了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。也没有什么止痛药在里边，而完全是把寒去掉了。还有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胰脏炎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，胰脏发炎的话也会有雷鸣切痛，肚子痛的很厉害的症状。还有呢，像"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腹膜炎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，腹膜炎呢，当你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看到寒症看到雷鸣的时候，我们都可以用附子粳米汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，腹膜炎也可以用。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161859-yu5l6z0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161859-yu5l6z0","updated":"20240422161859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以诸位在看经方的时候，在煮汤的方式，看你的剂量是多少，那你可以到药房去把它拿起来配配，才这几味药，一点点，三碗煮成一碗，如果药量比较多，六碗煮成两碗，再多点，九碗煮成三碗哦。就依此类推上去就可以了。"}]}]}